not be seen in modern times. The starry sky has long been replaced by bustling neon lights. The world is extravagant with fireworks, but she still likes natural beauty. She once thought about buying a house in the suburbs, where she could have sex with her lover at sunrise and rest at sunset. It's just that this dream is so far away. \"What era is it now?\" The man in black was stunned again. He didn't expect Qi Lin to change the subject so quickly. \"Phoenix seven years.\" \"Phoenix seven years?\" Qi Lin repeated in surprise. There is no such year in history. This means that she has traveled to an imaginary world. This is good, she doesn't need to care about history. \"Is this called Phoenix Country?\" The man in black nodded. Facing Qi Lin's questions and reactions, he was curious. Could it be that this woman lives in the jungle and no longer knows the outside world? Even if you don’t know the time, you should at least know the year number. In the darkness, the man in black and Qi Lin frowned at the same time. The man in black turned his face and looked at Qi Lin carefully. Even though the sky was completely dark, he could still distinguish things clearly. During the day, he only saw Qi Lin's side face. The situation was urgent and he didn't pay attention to it, but he always felt that he had seen it somewhere. He searched carefully, but there was no result. Could it be... The man in black's pupils shrank, his brows revealed a strong murderous aura, and even the surrounding air became extremely cold. Qi Lin felt the change in the man in black. Just when she wanted to ask clearly, her head was pressed tightly against the trunk of the tree, and the rough bark made her face hurt. \"Isn't it too late to think of killing me now?\" Qi Lin didn't know what the man in black was planning to do. If he really wanted to kill her, why would he take her to a safe place instead of just throwing her to the wolves. \"I'm still wondering why you saved me, a stranger.\" The man in b